                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Do we need to do something so we do not automatically power on the host?  Do we need something tied to presence detect of the COM-e?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 9,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "MichaelKao-Quanta",
                        "email": "Michael.Kao@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "MichaelKao-Quanta"
                    },
                    "message": "At this stage, our platform does not include any defined use cases or dependencies on COM\u2011e. Therefore, we do not have related power\u2011on or presence\u2011detect requirements for COM\u2011e at the moment."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 12,
                    "reviewer": {
